WEBVTT

00:05.380 --> 00:07.030
Are you... leaving?

00:07.340 --> 00:08.380
Yes... the villagers are becoming suspicious.

00:08.380 --> 00:10.480
Yes... the villagers are becoming suspicious.

00:10.490 --> 00:12.720
They think my sister might still be alive.

00:13.470 --> 00:14.490
I see...

00:14.970 --> 00:17.490
Aono's alive...

00:19.000 --> 00:22.170
I originally came here to become the sacrifice

00:22.640 --> 00:24.750
that would calm the curse of the Yaka.

00:25.230 --> 00:29.740
Of course, neither of us believe in that any more.

00:30.060 --> 00:30.700
It's just-

00:30.960 --> 00:31.510
It's fine.

00:31.910 --> 00:32.760
I understand.

00:34.000 --> 00:36.250
I've always been by myself, so I'll be fine.

00:36.830 --> 00:39.260
Even if you two were to disappear...

00:46.710 --> 00:49.110
Who said anything about disappearing?

00:49.120 --> 00:51.590
Let's leave this place. The three of us.

00:51.840 --> 00:52.740
It's fine with you, right?

00:53.100 --> 00:55.450
The three of us? Together?

00:55.460 --> 00:56.140
That's right.

00:56.440 --> 00:58.310
My sister and I talked this over yesterday.

00:58.740 --> 01:02.530
Even if we were to leave this place, we'd rather leave together with you.

01:02.940 --> 01:05.710
So stop saying such things.

01:06.310 --> 01:08.790
You're no longer alone.

01:16.070 --> 01:17.930
Huh? That's odd.

01:22.240 --> 01:23.050
Stand back.

01:28.690 --> 01:29.790
One... two!

01:29.790 --> 01:30.230
One... two!

01:48.240 --> 01:54.660
hane ga shiroku hikari mabushiku tondeyuku

01:48.240 --> 01:54.660
White feathers gleam and fly away brightly

01:55.080 --> 02:01.710
kokoro dake nosete hoshii no ni

01:55.080 --> 02:01.710
Though I only want to set my heart on them

02:02.710 --> 02:08.970
tsumetai te wo nobasu todokanai... shitteru

02:02.710 --> 02:08.970
I extend my cold hands - They won't reach... I know

02:09.600 --> 02:16.690
dakedo ima furetai kimi ni

02:09.600 --> 02:16.690
But I want to touch you now

02:16.900 --> 02:22.820
natsukashii kaze ni ha ano koro no fune

02:16.900 --> 02:22.820
On that nostalgic wind - A ship from the past

02:23.230 --> 02:31.240
maboroshi ga omoide wo miseta

02:23.230 --> 02:31.240
An illusion showed me memories

02:32.310 --> 02:41.250
"wasurenai" dareka no koe ga setsunaku hibiku

02:32.310 --> 02:41.250
"I won't forget" Someone's voice echoes painfully

02:41.420 --> 02:46.340
hajimaru yokan ni furuete

02:41.420 --> 02:46.340
Trembling with a foreboding

02:46.630 --> 02:54.680
"wasuretai" negau jibun ga wakaranai

02:46.630 --> 02:54.680
"I want to forget" I cannot understand myself for hoping so

02:55.060 --> 03:04.400
matteiru yurarenagara yume hitotsu wo

02:55.060 --> 03:04.400
I shall wait while swaying, for that one dream

03:11.800 --> 03:17.140
The Boundary
Between Light and Dark

03:17.730 --> 03:18.680
Matsuri...

03:19.500 --> 03:22.020
Sorry for coming unexpectedly,

03:22.570 --> 03:24.510
but I need to speak with you again.

03:28.850 --> 03:30.460
So you've decided to leave this place.

03:30.720 --> 03:33.500
Yorito chose me.

03:33.980 --> 03:36.110
He's chosen to live together with me.

03:36.120 --> 03:37.790
I've already heard about it from Yorito.

03:37.790 --> 03:40.000
He said, he wants to make you happy.

03:40.510 --> 03:41.740
So he said that...

03:42.140 --> 03:43.170
I'm happy for you.

03:44.160 --> 03:47.340
He thinks of you the most after all.

03:48.060 --> 03:50.000
He doesn't want to bring you any grief.

03:50.360 --> 03:52.110
Nor does he want to cause you any suffering.

03:52.880 --> 03:54.350
That's all he wants.

03:55.050 --> 03:56.210
That's why... I couldn't bear it any longer.

03:56.210 --> 03:57.890
That's why... I couldn't bear it any longer.

03:59.170 --> 04:01.830
I like Yorito, too.

04:02.250 --> 04:05.370
After I met him and spent some time together with him,

04:05.910 --> 04:09.080
I thought, I really don't want to leave his side after all.

04:09.660 --> 04:11.280
I thought I'd be lonely.

04:11.950 --> 04:12.950
Matsuri...

04:13.830 --> 04:14.920
Hand over Yorito... to me.

04:14.920 --> 04:15.520
Hand over Yorito... to me.

04:15.890 --> 04:16.700
Are you serious?

04:17.020 --> 04:18.670
To tell the truth... I already have him.

04:18.670 --> 04:19.880
To tell the truth... I already have him.

04:20.410 --> 04:22.790
He's at my place right now.

04:22.800 --> 04:23.730
Impossible...

04:24.130 --> 04:26.530
Let's settle who can stay by Yorito's side once and for all.

04:38.000 --> 04:39.140
No Trespassing

05:06.540 --> 05:08.080
I bought some popcorn.

05:08.360 --> 05:12.620
It's not like a movie will be shown here or anything.

05:12.810 --> 05:14.710
It's for the mood. The mood.

05:18.840 --> 05:21.790
Hey, hey, what's going to happen to him?

05:23.520 --> 05:24.350
He'll be okay.

05:24.650 --> 05:27.810
The leading man always has a happy ending.

05:28.230 --> 05:29.200
He just died!

05:29.610 --> 05:31.530
His face was cut in two!

05:31.840 --> 05:33.410
So we're watching a horror flick...

05:33.930 --> 05:36.780
You do watch horror movies on dates after all.

05:37.210 --> 05:38.100
I guess you're right.

05:38.590 --> 05:40.190
I don't like horror movies, though.

05:40.480 --> 05:41.590
You scared?

05:41.820 --> 05:43.200
It's not like that.

05:43.460 --> 05:44.340
Really?

05:44.750 --> 05:46.050
Yeah, really.

05:46.250 --> 05:47.850
Next time we'll watch-

05:53.450 --> 05:54.940
Let's go... watch one someday.

05:54.940 --> 05:55.960
Let's go... watch one someday.

06:00.760 --> 06:01.600
How's my sister?

06:02.010 --> 06:04.320
I think she'll come.

06:04.630 --> 06:06.470
I said some pretty harsh things to her.

06:06.970 --> 06:07.800
Sorry about that.

06:08.120 --> 06:09.040
No.

06:09.390 --> 06:11.170
I should be the one apologizing.

06:11.810 --> 06:14.180
This is something between Aono and me.

06:14.670 --> 06:17.060
You were dragged into this.

06:18.990 --> 06:21.150
That person's jumper looks suspicious.

06:21.150 --> 06:23.060
See? His movements are unnatural.

06:23.420 --> 06:24.260
See? Look over there.

06:25.220 --> 06:26.670
Ah, you're right!

06:26.670 --> 06:28.780
That dirt on his foot is from earlier...

06:28.780 --> 06:29.250
Yeah.

06:29.500 --> 06:32.120
It's the dirt from the place where the couple was assaulted.

06:32.410 --> 06:34.760
Seems like the genre changed.

06:35.440 --> 06:36.100
Oh yeah.

06:36.100 --> 06:37.080
It was a horror movie.

06:39.360 --> 06:40.060
Hey.

06:42.080 --> 06:44.050
What... does it feel like to die?

06:44.050 --> 06:45.710
What... does it feel like to die?

06:47.240 --> 06:48.110
I don't know...

06:48.410 --> 06:50.460
I've lived for a long time...

06:50.460 --> 06:52.200
...but even I don't know that.

06:52.470 --> 06:53.380
Not even I know...

06:57.680 --> 06:58.410
Huh?

06:59.040 --> 06:59.650
What is it?

06:59.870 --> 07:00.880
Is something wrong?

07:01.160 --> 07:03.520
Was this place a vacant lot before?

07:05.880 --> 07:07.400
I really don't remember.

07:26.930 --> 07:28.290
Matsuri, you're here, aren't you?

07:28.290 --> 07:29.220
Matsuri, you're here, aren't you?

07:30.070 --> 07:31.040
Where is Yorito?

07:32.460 --> 07:34.190
He's somewhere nearby.

07:34.650 --> 07:36.290
There's no point in fighting.

07:36.740 --> 07:38.440
Even if you defeat me,

07:38.840 --> 07:41.120
without my Yaka powers,

07:41.620 --> 07:43.650
Yorito won't be able to keep on existing.

07:44.000 --> 07:45.660
Yes, I know.

07:46.080 --> 07:47.030
But that's fine.

07:47.830 --> 07:49.130
I'll defeat you,

07:49.710 --> 07:52.140
and erase Yorito's pitiful existence.

07:52.690 --> 07:54.190
That's... my objective.

07:54.190 --> 07:55.710
That's... my objective.

07:56.430 --> 07:57.490
So you're serious about this?

07:59.630 --> 08:00.190
Yes.

08:18.270 --> 08:19.360
That can't be possible!

08:19.360 --> 08:20.270
Why?

08:20.930 --> 08:22.320
Forget about that! Just run!

08:22.590 --> 08:24.360
You don't have to die!

08:24.610 --> 08:27.560
But if I do that, everyone will be in trouble.

08:27.560 --> 08:28.370
Still...

08:29.050 --> 08:31.590
If I become a sacrifice for the Yaka,

08:31.590 --> 08:33.260
everyone would be able to lead happy lives.

08:33.690 --> 08:34.860
I'm fine with that.

08:50.880 --> 08:51.730
Yorito?

08:52.540 --> 08:53.530
Sister!

08:54.980 --> 08:55.970
Thank heavens.

08:56.520 --> 08:57.810
You're alive.

08:58.370 --> 08:59.420
Yorito...

09:01.970 --> 09:02.990
Matsuri...

09:03.540 --> 09:05.000
She's... the Yaka.

09:05.000 --> 09:05.810
She's... the Yaka.

09:20.960 --> 09:21.890
It's...

09:22.530 --> 09:23.780
It's all my fault.

09:24.540 --> 09:26.120
I was the sacrifice,

09:26.480 --> 09:28.180
yet I kept on living.

09:29.900 --> 09:31.800
It's all because I didn't die!

09:55.960 --> 09:57.410
Hand over Yorito.

09:58.310 --> 09:59.080
No.

09:59.500 --> 10:00.420
Give him back!

10:00.420 --> 10:01.440
It's impossible.

10:01.740 --> 10:03.730
The real Yorito no longer exists.

10:04.000 --> 10:04.710
Yes, he does.

10:04.890 --> 10:07.250
The real Yorito died back then.

10:07.670 --> 10:10.220
That's why he can't be by your side.

10:10.230 --> 10:12.760
In that case, I was supposed to be dead, too.

10:13.090 --> 10:14.590
I should've died together with Yorito.

10:14.590 --> 10:15.540
That's-

10:15.540 --> 10:18.020
You're the one who ruined everything!

10:18.470 --> 10:20.130
No one asked you to do that!

10:20.380 --> 10:21.300
Yet you...

10:21.630 --> 10:22.650
You!

10:22.660 --> 10:23.450
That's right...

10:23.800 --> 10:25.020
That's why... I'll return everything back to normal.

10:25.020 --> 10:26.650
That's why... I'll return everything back to normal.

10:57.260 --> 10:59.740
Forgive me, Aono.

11:01.400 --> 11:02.700
I was just... really lonely.

11:02.700 --> 11:04.270
I was just... really lonely.

11:04.560 --> 11:06.760
I realized that you can't live alone...

11:06.980 --> 11:12.310
Because I learned of the warmth of having someone close to you.

11:13.140 --> 11:13.930
That's why...

11:14.290 --> 11:15.070
I...

11:39.440 --> 11:40.350
Sis.

11:46.240 --> 11:47.440
This can't be happening...

11:47.690 --> 11:53.030
The only thing I can do is bring deceased humans back to life as Yakas.

11:53.810 --> 11:54.810
And Yorito?

11:55.650 --> 11:56.950
I looked for him, but...

12:00.380 --> 12:01.290
Why?

12:02.880 --> 12:05.390
Why did you bring me back to life?

12:06.200 --> 12:09.840
I don't want to continue living in a world without Yorito!

12:27.830 --> 12:29.650
Please, don't go.

12:30.130 --> 12:31.080
Please!

12:32.420 --> 12:33.650
Matsuri...

12:38.040 --> 12:39.170
This can't be...

13:12.100 --> 13:13.020
Yorito.

13:41.370 --> 13:42.130
This is...

13:48.210 --> 13:49.090
Sis.

13:49.870 --> 13:50.670
Yorito.

13:54.900 --> 13:55.660
I can't go.

13:56.660 --> 13:58.320
I can't go with you.

13:58.830 --> 14:02.320
Matsuri is trying to erase you!

14:02.560 --> 14:03.290
I know...

14:05.070 --> 14:06.580
I asked her to do so.

14:11.170 --> 14:13.340
Because I'm not really Yorito.

14:13.580 --> 14:14.790
I'm nobody.

14:15.410 --> 14:17.840
I'm an existence that's not supposed to be here.

14:18.490 --> 14:19.450
That's why...

14:20.210 --> 14:22.040
I'll return to my true form...

14:22.970 --> 14:24.440
together with you.

14:24.440 --> 14:25.130
No.

14:25.840 --> 14:26.660
Sis?

14:26.660 --> 14:27.490
No!

14:27.870 --> 14:29.790
If both of us disappear,

14:29.790 --> 14:31.240
there won't be anything left!

14:31.240 --> 14:34.560
If we vanish here, it's like nothing happened at all.

14:34.760 --> 14:36.720
If that were the right choice,

14:37.240 --> 14:39.570
I wouldn't have done all this in the first place!

14:40.120 --> 14:44.030
Yet because I thought it was possible with the powers of a Yaka,

14:44.510 --> 14:48.890
I thought that I could be together with you once more.

14:50.530 --> 14:53.120
Are you telling me that was meaningless?

14:53.440 --> 14:55.660
All the grief and suffering I went through.

14:55.870 --> 14:57.950
And when I finally got you back...

14:58.210 --> 15:00.150
Are you telling me it was all meaningless?!

15:00.150 --> 15:00.870
No-

15:00.880 --> 15:01.710
Yorito!

15:16.490 --> 15:19.790
I must get to where Yorito is. Quickly.

15:34.880 --> 15:36.960
It must've started by now.

15:38.100 --> 15:38.870
It's cold.

15:39.630 --> 15:43.220
We got off because you wanted juice, right?

15:44.440 --> 15:45.720
When does the next train come?

15:46.000 --> 15:47.630
There won't be one until tomorrow morning.

15:48.770 --> 15:49.970
This sucks.

15:50.810 --> 15:51.930
It should start soon.

15:53.090 --> 15:53.980
Yeah...

16:00.250 --> 16:01.110
Are you worried?

16:01.310 --> 16:02.160
Not really.

16:02.490 --> 16:05.750
Because Matsuri made up her mind.

16:06.700 --> 16:09.990
Hers was a face without any hesitations or doubts.

16:10.520 --> 16:14.250
She doesn't need help or any worrying.

16:15.640 --> 16:16.730
She can do it.

16:17.450 --> 16:19.500
No matter how hard it is.

16:19.900 --> 16:20.810
I guess.

16:27.430 --> 16:28.570
If it's those two...

16:42.430 --> 16:43.360
Sis!

16:43.370 --> 16:45.420
I'll remove those once this is over.

16:45.820 --> 16:48.520
If Matsuri were to die... I won't go with you.

16:48.520 --> 16:50.200
If Matsuri were to die... I won't go with you.

16:51.880 --> 16:53.700
I'll take you by force.

16:54.130 --> 16:56.120
Because I belong to you?

16:56.130 --> 16:56.830
You're wrong.

16:57.080 --> 16:59.200
Because you created me?

16:59.200 --> 17:00.120
You're wrong!

17:00.470 --> 17:03.140
If I were the real Yorito,

17:03.650 --> 17:05.380
I wouldn't have said those things.

17:06.120 --> 17:09.680
The real Yorito made you anxious.

17:10.310 --> 17:12.540
He did things you didn't want him to do.

17:13.720 --> 17:16.420
But that's what it means to be alive.

17:16.720 --> 17:20.020
Things will work against you, and bad things do happen.

17:20.530 --> 17:22.640
You can't stop them from happening.

17:22.870 --> 17:24.260
But I can!

17:24.580 --> 17:28.900
If the time comes, I can erase my memories and pretend that nothing happened.

17:28.910 --> 17:29.650
That's-

17:30.080 --> 17:30.920
But...

17:31.650 --> 17:32.830
that's why I'm empty.

17:33.120 --> 17:34.630
That's not true.

17:35.660 --> 17:36.640
Sis!

17:37.060 --> 17:39.530
You're Yorito... my brother.

17:39.530 --> 17:40.920
You're Yorito... my brother.

17:40.930 --> 17:41.990
Sis!

17:44.230 --> 17:44.920
Sis!

17:58.170 --> 17:59.040
Matsuri...

18:01.010 --> 18:03.360
Let's end this.

18:03.950 --> 18:05.110
Yes.

18:05.110 --> 18:08.360
I was thinking the same thing.

19:19.390 --> 19:20.230
Matsuri!

19:34.580 --> 19:35.520
Sis!

19:36.100 --> 19:37.020
Wait for me there.

19:38.030 --> 19:39.330
It'll be over soon.

19:53.700 --> 19:54.640
Yorito!

19:57.600 --> 20:00.910
Let's end this, Sis.

20:01.200 --> 20:02.130
Yorito...

20:12.830 --> 20:13.660
Yorito!

20:13.790 --> 20:15.510
Matsuri, do it now!

20:22.440 --> 20:24.660
Yorito, let go of me!

20:43.270 --> 20:44.490
The sky...

20:45.810 --> 20:46.620
The blue...

20:47.080 --> 20:48.270
...sky.

21:02.290 --> 21:05.420
If you pour your lifeforce into that sword,

21:05.920 --> 21:07.330
and transfer it to a Yaka,

21:07.920 --> 21:09.750
you can turn it back to a human.

21:10.830 --> 21:12.540
I'll return Aono into a human.

21:45.780 --> 21:46.380
No...

21:46.950 --> 21:48.170
No!

21:49.160 --> 21:51.920
Now everything will return back to the way it was.

21:53.770 --> 21:54.990
Everything...

21:56.650 --> 21:58.550
No!

22:14.270 --> 22:22.940
iro aseta page no kioku hitomi tojireba yomigaeru

22:14.270 --> 22:22.940
Memories on a faded page, they revive when I close my eyes

22:23.360 --> 22:32.120
adokenai shoujo no inori
habatakeyo kibou no sora he

22:23.360 --> 22:32.120
Prayers of an innocent girl
Fly away to the sky of hope

22:32.240 --> 22:36.540
nageku mamonaku  toki wa nagareru

22:32.240 --> 22:36.540
With no time to regret, time will flow

22:36.830 --> 22:41.630
hitori tachidomaru kedo

22:36.830 --> 22:41.630
Even though I stand alone

22:42.880 --> 22:48.390
yume mamoru shirabe  kuchizu samuno

22:42.880 --> 22:48.390
A tune to protect your dreams, I sing to myself

22:48.550 --> 22:52.890
hitobito ga nemuri ni tsukeba

22:48.550 --> 22:52.890
When people go into slumber

22:53.100 --> 23:00.810
mata au hi no negai tsumugeru deshou  ai no ito

22:53.100 --> 23:00.810
Their wish to unite can be woven. The thread of love

23:01.110 --> 23:11.240
yasashisa wo sasou  otogibanashi anata kara osowatta no yo

23:01.110 --> 23:11.240
Fairy tales that elicit kindness I learned that from you

23:11.410 --> 23:21.170
modorimashou  sotto ano koro no omoi ni

23:11.410 --> 23:21.170
Let us return gently to the memories of those times

23:30.930 --> 23:45.950
Final Episode

23:30.930 --> 23:45.950
Sky

23:31.800 --> 23:33.180
Reaching the sky...

23:33.430 --> 23:34.720
Touching the sky...

23:35.100 --> 23:37.930
I wanted to find out that I wasn't really alone.

23:38.730 --> 23:41.140
I wanted to know where the wandering clouds were heading to.

23:41.690 --> 23:43.440
I kept on praying more than anyone else.

23:44.400 --> 23:45.150
The sky...
